# Line endings for the wrapper.
#
# This repo is worked on from a Windows laptop with core.autocrlf=true and from
# a Mac. Git normalised gradlew to LF in the index on its own, but that is a
# property of one machine's config, not of the repo, and a future checkout with
# a different setting would hand the Mac a gradlew full of carriage returns.
# A CRLF shell script fails on Unix with "bad interpreter", which reads as a
# broken toolchain rather than as a line-ending problem, so it is worth the two
# lines here to make it impossible.
gradlew text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

# Xcode's project file is line-sensitive and merges badly when a tool rewrites
# its endings. Pin it the same way.
*.pbxproj text eol=lf
